tasks.acceptance_criteria:
The wrapper enforces a configurable per-finding tool-call cap with a documented default;
the cap is flag-gated and fails safe to off; reviewers that cannot be capped are
documented in-code.

tasks.description:
Unit-test the router exhaustively: lens gating per path class (concurrency lens only on
async/queue-handler paths; security lens always on auth/session/input-boundary paths;
docs-only => minimal graph); no-match => full graph + warning; floor tier always present;
low-risk => cheapest tier (cost default); determinism (same input => same output); and
that the security lens cannot be gated off a protected path even by a config entry that
omits it.
